<title>UK: Westbury Plc H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Westbury Plc H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Aug. 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.4		    vs 6.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.15		   vs 2.00</p>
<p> Pretax		     9.7		    vs 6.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   131.5		  vs 89.6</p>
<p> Operating profit	 12.2		   vs 8.0</p>
<p> Interest		   2.5		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Tax			  3.1		    vs 2.1</p>
<p> Net taxed		  6.6		    vs 4.4</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan. 6, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  Nov. 26</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Nov. 18</p>
<p>NOTE: Westbury Plc is a house builder.</p>
</text>
